        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Crown Jewel fand 2025, am 11. Oktober, in der RAC Arena in Perth, Westaustralien, Australien, statt.\r Match Card:\r Australian Street Fight: Roman Reigns vs. Bronson Reed  WWE Women's Crown Jewel 2025 Title Match: Stephanie Vaquer vs. Tiffany Stratton\r John Cena vs. AJ Styles\r Tag Team Match: IYO SKY & Rhea Ripley vs. The Kabuki Warriors (Asuka & Kairi Sane)\r WWE Crown Jewel 2025 Title Match: Seth Rollins vs. Cody Rhodes",
